msgstr "UUID task identifier. Used in the reply email subject."

#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:239
msgid "``task_token``"
msgstr "``task_token``"

#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:240
msgid ""
"UUID токен безопасности, сгенерированный при создании задачи. Защищает от"
" несанкционированного завершения задачи."
msgstr ""
"UUID security token generated when the task is created. Protects against "
"unauthorized task completion."

#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:242
msgid "``mail_for_answer``"
msgstr "``mail_for_answer``"

#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:243
msgid ""
"Email для отправки ответа с вердиктом. Берётся из конфигурации ``lazy-"
"approval-mail-for-reply``."
msgstr ""
"Email address for sending the reply with a verdict. Taken from the "
"``lazy-approval-mail-for-reply`` configuration."

#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:245
msgid "``default_comment``"
msgstr "``default_comment``"

#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:246
msgid ""
"Комментарий по умолчанию. Берётся из конфигурации ``lazy-approval-"
"default-comment``."
msgstr ""
"Default comment. Taken from the ``lazy-approval-default-comment`` "
"configuration."

#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:254
msgid "5.2 FTL-шаблон с вердиктами"
msgstr "5.2 FTL Template with Verdicts"

